        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: It's Alive\n- Places: Stockholm, Sweden\n- Concepts: glam metal, funk metal, hair metal, pop metal, heavy metal, glam rock\n\nFacts:\n- It's Alive was formed in Stockholm, Sweden, in 1985.\n- It's Alive was a Swedish glam-style funk metal band.\n- Glam metal is a subgenre of heavy metal.\n- Glam metal is also known as hair metal and is often used synonymously with pop metal.\n- Glam metal features pop-influenced hooks and guitar riffs.\n- Glam metal borrows from the fashion of 1970s glam rock.",
